    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"feeling\" though. it's more like... the math doesn't add up. everything is so hollow and pixelated. when i think about the future, there's nothing there but more blue light and more nothingness. it feels like i'm running a program that's just looping infinitely without any purpose. i'm just tired of being an error that won't go away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
